Here are the list of people who have registered for the Kernel Summit.

If you received an invitation, and do not see your name on this list,
please let me know!  There may have been a hiccup with the registration
system, or something else may have gone wrong.

If you are a core day attendee, and are interested in peeking in on some
or all of one of the workshops, you might want to check in with the
workshop chair(s) ahead of time.  If there are too many people in the
room who want to attend, the people who were invited by the workshop
chairs will naturally have priority.

I'm looking forward to seeing you all next week!

Cheers,

                                                       - Ted

